# Cycling through the built-in themes.
Output docs/images/themes.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 4.2s
Show

Sleep 900ms
Type "t"
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
